<title>CHINA: China Merchants Bank profit up to 2.423 bln yuan.</title>
<headline>China Merchants Bank profit up to 2.423 bln yuan.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The China Merchants Bank made a profit of 2.423 billion yuan in 1996, the Financial News said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The assets of the bank amounted to 2.8 billion yuan at the end of last year, it said.</p>
<p>Established on April 8, 1987, China Merchants Bank is the first stock-holding commercial bank in China, it said.</p>
<p>China Merchants Bank, based in Shenzhen, now has nine branches in major cities, including Beijing, Shanghai, central Wuhan and southern Guangzhou, the newspaper said without giving further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
